      "text": "A convicted child predator and repeat offender thought he could slip back into the U.S unnoticed…the #PremierSector had other plans for him.\n\nAgents located and arrested the Mexican criminal alien, after being released from the John J. Benoit Detention Center. His criminal history includes:\n\n❌ 2007: DUI—misdemeanor (convicted)\n❌ 2021: Possession of Controlled Substances for Sale—felony (Convicted)\n❌ 2022: DUI—misdemeanor (convicted)\n❌ 2022: Lascivious Act with a child (convicted)\n\nHe now faces federal prosecution for illegal re-entry after removal.\n\n#CBP #DHS #BorderPatrol #Indio",
